        PowerSeries.coeff (i + 1) B) = ∑ i ∈ Finset.range (k + 1),
        PowerSeries.coeff (k + 1 - (i + 1)) A * PowerSeries.coeff (i + 1) C := by
        rw [← hrecL, ← hrecA, hcoeff (k + 1) hnN]
