the contribution to indices close to, but different from, `x`.-/
noncomputable def dirichletPerronNearMass
    (a : ℕ → ℂ) (x : ℕ) (U : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑' n : ℕ, ‖a n‖ * dirichletPerronNearError x U n

/--
