series is summable, this is the absolute coefficient mass used to control Perron truncation away
from the endpoint.-/
noncomputable def dirichletPerronCoefficientMass
    (a : ℕ → ℂ) (alpha : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑' n : ℕ, ‖LSeries.term a (alpha : ℂ) n‖

/--
