/--
Exponent boxes for the `2 * j` multiplicatively localized Heath–Brown factors. Each exponent is
at most `⌈log B / log Θ⌉₊`, and the product of the box scales lies between `A / Θ^(2 * j)` and
`B * Θ^(2 * j)`.-/
noncomputable def minorantHBBoxes (j : ℕ) (A B Θ : ℝ) : Finset (Fin (2 * j) → ℕ) :=
  (Fintype.piFinset (fun _ : Fin (2 * j) =>
    Finset.range (⌈Real.log B / Real.log Θ⌉₊ + 1))).filter (fun ν =>
      A / Θ ^ (2 * j) ≤ (∏ i, Θ ^ (ν i)) ∧
        (∏ i, Θ ^ (ν i)) ≤ B * Θ ^ (2 * j))

