    simpa only [I, F, Nat.mod_one, eq_self_iff_true, Finset.filter_true,
      Nat.cast_one, div_one] using
      hprogression M hM 1 0 (by decide)
        (by simpa only [Nat.cast_one] using Real.one_le_rpow hMone hθ0.le) (by decide)
