        pow_le_pow_left₀ (by exact_mod_cast (hEpos M).le) (hsmall M).1 (2 ^ b)
    · simpa [S, T, pow_iterate] using
        pow_le_pow_left₀ (Real.exp_nonneg _) (hsmall M).2 (2 ^ b)
